      "diff": "@@ -90,7 +90,8 @@ See the “New and Updated Features” section below for more details.\n \n The following features are new (or have been significantly updated) since version 3.7.2:\n \n-Nothing of note.\n+* The Windows installers now ship with Npcap 1.70.\n+  They previously shipped with Npcap 1.60.\n \n The following features are new (or have been significantly updated) since version 3.7.1:\n \n",
